# UI Guardrails

Full contract: `docs/UI-GUARDRAILS.md`.

**LOCKED OS UI CONTRACT — do not modify for feature-specific work.**

Do not change these in feature work (Interactions, Tournaments, Dashboard, Visit, data-model):

- Recruit card desktop split: identity left, Academic Interests + Schools of Interest upper-right
- Canonical slots: `RecruitSummaryAcademicInterestsSlot`, `RecruitSummarySchoolsOfInterestSlot`
- Adaptive Workspace field grids: `WorkspaceFieldGrid` + `[data-aw-field-grid]` in `src/app/layout-lock.css`
- Directory Search / Views row
- Recruiting nested nav geometry

Shared shell owns geometry. Feature modules own content only.

Feature work must not edit:

- `src/app/layout-lock.css`
- `src/components/adaptive-workspace/WorkspaceContent.tsx` (`WorkspaceFieldGrid`)
- `src/features/recruiting/components/RecruitSummaryLockedSlots.tsx`
- `src/components/person-workspace-shell/PersonWorkspaceShell.tsx`
- `tests/layout.cold-load.spec.ts`

Mobile may collapse via CSS `@media (max-width: 767px)` only. Do not use JavaScript viewport initialization for these layouts.
